g\\sin\\theta=ma"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"a=0.4\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"当传送带以"},{"type":"math","value":"0.2\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"的加速度启动，物块与传送带之间是静摩擦力，因此物块的加速度也是"},{"type":"math","value":"a=0.2\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"由"},{"type":"math","value":"v^2=2as"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_B=2\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"（2）要使物块到达C点速度最大，需要考虑物块以最大加速度加速和物块到达B点会不会离开斜面做斜抛运动。\nB点不离开斜面条件："},{"type":"math","value":"mg\\cos\\theta=m\\frac{v_B^2}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_B=2\\sqrt{2}\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"score","value":"（2分）"},{"type":"text","value":"由"},{"type":"math","value":"v^2=2as"},{"type":"text","value":"得加速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"a=0.4\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"物块的最大加速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"0.4\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以物块以最大加速度加速运动到B点，由"},{"type":"math","value":"v_B=\\sqrt{2aL}=2\\sqrt{2}\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"B点到C点用动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac12mv_C^2-\\frac12mv_B^2=-mgR(1-\\cos\\theta)"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_C=2\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"传送带启动的加速度"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{\\text{传}}\\geq0.4\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"score","value":"（2分）"},{"type":"text","value":"（3）①"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum mv_0\\Delta t=m\\sum v_m\\Delta t+M\\sum v_M\\Delta t"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum v_m\\Delta t-\\sum v_M\\Delta t=0.381\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得："},{"type":"math","value":"x_m=0.7905\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"score","value":"（2分）"},{"type":"text","value":"（注：计算到"},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\sqrt{0.7905^2+0.081^2}\\,\\mathrm{m}=0.7946\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"本小题也给满分）\n②当小物块到达F点时有"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_C=(m+M)v_F"},{"type":"text","value":"当小物块再次到达E点时"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_C=mv_3+Mv_4"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac12(m+M)v_F^2+mgr=\\frac12mv_3^2+\\frac12Mv_4^2"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_4=1.9\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"math","value":"v_3=0.1\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"math","value":"F_N-mg=m\\frac{(v_3-v_4)^2}{r}"},{"type":"math","value":"F_N=50\\,\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"score","value":"（3分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--taizhou-yimo-2511-q17","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--taizhou-yimo-2511","source_question_id":"taizhou-yimo-2511-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"cac173a2546b46b25db90028b08a1db29eca20a32170913fecadeb622ab1158d","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. （12分）某兴趣小组设计了一电磁弹射装置，其工作原理可简化如图，恒流源、固定的金属导轨 "},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":"、 "},{"type":"math","value":"M'N'"},{"type":"text","value":" 、导电底座EF，三者构成电磁驱动回路。将绝缘飞机模型安放在导电底座EF上，合上开关S，恒流源工作，输出的电流在导轨间产生磁场（磁场的磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 与电流大小成正比），处在磁场中的导电底座受到安培力作用向右加速，从而实现弹射。H、K两处用极短绝缘物质将金属导轨分为左右两部分，左侧光滑右侧粗糙，H、K与导轨右侧距离为6.5m，右侧导轨间存在 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}=0.5T"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场，底座返回系统由右边 "},{"type":"math","value":"R=0.1\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 的定值电阻与金属导轨相连构成。某次测试中闭合开关S，恒流源输出的电流在导轨间产生磁场，在3秒钟内，将模型飞机由静止加速到 "},{"type":"math","value":"v=15\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的起飞速度后脱离底座起飞，此时EF刚好到达H、K处。已知导轨间距为L=2m，底座EF的质量为m=1kg，等效电阻为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r=0.4\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（1）若输出电流增加一倍，则飞机的加速度为多大；\n(2)底座 EF 通过 H、K 点后开始减速，底座 EF 减速过程中与导轨间的动摩擦因数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1}=0.5"},{"type":"text","value":" ，经过 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=2s"},{"type":"text","value":" 后 EF 速度减为零，求电阻 R 产生的焦耳热为多少；\n（3）底座静止后让磁场 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 极短时间内均匀消失，导轨与 EF 间返回动摩擦因数变为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{2}=0.32"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求底座返回的距离为多少。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/4af821642028debc72dbc9de790b8731495cdd6a8f9825f6752aa9dbfd0efe34.png","width":1032,"height":416,"width_mm":121.175,"row_group":"taizhou-yimo-2511-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）答案：（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{0}=\\frac{V}{t}=5m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"当电流增加一倍，产生的磁场也增加一倍，安培力增加为原来4倍，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"a=4a_{0}=20m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（3分）\n(2) 由"},{"type":"math","value":"mv = \\mu mg t + \\sum BILt = \\mu mg t + \\frac{B^{2}L^{2}x}{R + r}"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"x = 2.5m"},{"type":"text","value":"……（2分）\n由能量守恒定律："},{"type":"math","value":"Q + \\mu mgx = \\frac{1}{2} mv^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"Q = 100J"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{R} = \\frac{Q}{R + r} R = 20J"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n（3）底座EF静止时离右端距离为4m，此时磁场消失过程中产生感应电流，安培力使底座EF获得向左速度V'有："},{"type":"math","value":"mv'=\\sum BILt=\\sum B\\frac{\\Delta BL\\Delta x}{\\Delta t(R+r)}L\\Delta t=\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{B^{2}L^{2}\\Delta x}{(R+r)}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)得："},{"type":"math","value":"V'=4m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)由："},{"type":"math","value":"V'^{2}=2as=2\\mu gs"},{"type":"math","value":"s=2.5m"},{"type":"text","value":"刚好回到HK处。 (2分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--taizhou-yimo-2511-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--taizhou-yimo-2511","source_question_id":"taizhou-yimo-2511-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"cf18414342250317183cbb094e39338ec3615e479305edee67c4c0f9ec3f95c0","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (13 分) 某种磁流体发电机其工作原理与霍尔效应类似。主体空腔为长、高、宽分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 的长方体，前后两个侧面是绝缘体，上下 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"N"},{"type":"text","value":" 面是导体电极，整个空间处于磁感应强度的大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" ，方向垂直纸面向里的匀强磁场中，由空间均匀分布质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电荷量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"q"},{"type":"text","value":" 的正电荷组成的离子流沿空腔以速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":" 向右流动，单位体积内正电荷个数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"n"},{"type":"text","value":" 。忽略离子重力。\n（1）开关都断开的情况下，求稳定后 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{MN}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（2）没有接通电路时，离子流流动中受到阻力为 "},{"type":"math","value":"f"},{"type":"text","value":" ，闭合 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，断开 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，为了维持离子流进出空腔速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":" 不变，在通道进出口离子流的压强差为多少；（设空腔内离子流的电阻率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho"},{"type":"text","value":" ）\n（3）当闭合开关 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，两极板间电压变小，离子流在通道内做复杂的曲线运动，设此时两极板电压为 U，求到达极板的电荷占比；\n（4）同时闭合开关 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，稳定后电路中电流为多少。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/dd003bb36291ea071f2e2c02862125a5e3384534626148df8eb7991e8ea907ce.png","width":820,"height":509,"width_mm":96.394,"row_group":"taizhou-yimo-2511-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 18 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）答案：（1）由左手定则可知正电荷向上偏转，M点电势高于N点电势，"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{MN}>0"},{"type":"text","value":"稳定后正离子受力平衡"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U_{MN}}{a}q=Bqv"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"U_{MN}=Bav"},{"type":"text","value":"……（3分）\n（2）空腔内离子整体受力平衡："},{"type":"math","value":"BIa+f=\\Delta Pab"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{Bav}{R+\\rho\\frac{a}{bL}}"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta P=\\frac{B^{2}aLv}{bRL+\\rho a}+\\frac{f}{ab}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（3分）\n（3）离子v分解为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"v-v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，使"},{"type":"math","value":"Bqv_{1}=\\frac{U}{a}q"},{"type":"text","value":"离子以"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"作匀速直线运动，同时以"},{"type":"math","value":"(v-v_{1})"},{"type":"text","value":"作匀速圆周运动，直径为d,有"},{"type":"math","value":"d=\\frac{2m(v-v_{1})}{Bq}"},{"type":"text","value":"到达极板的电荷占比"},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta=\\frac{d}{a}=\\frac{2m(Bav-U)}{B^{2}a^{2}q}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（3分）\n（注：若学生分类讨论，有"},{"type":"math","value":"d > a, \\eta = 1"},{"type":"text","value":"或"},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta = 100\\%"},{"type":"text","value":"即给1分）\n（4）接通"},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，外电路短路，极板电压为零，离子进入空腔后作匀速圆周运动，运动的直径为"},{"type":"math","value":"d'=\\frac{2mv}{Bq}"},{"type":"text","value":"则"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{Q}{t}=\\frac{d'bvtnq}{t}=\\frac{2mbnv^{2}}{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"（3分）\n若"},{"type":"math","value":"d'\\geq a,I=\\frac{Q}{t}=\\frac{nabvtq}{t}=nabvq"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）"}]}}]}
